---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of use" description="Terms governing use of the Accbase Advisory website.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms of use" lede="Last updated: replace with your publication date." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>This is a starting draft, not legal advice.</strong> Have it reviewed by a qualified professional before you publish, and replace this notice.</p>
      <h2>About this site</h2>
      <p>This website is operated by Accbase Advisory. By using it you agree to these terms.</p>
      <h2>No professional advice</h2>
      <p>Content on this website, including articles published under Insights, is general information only. It is not accounting, tax, legal or investment advice, and it does not create a client relationship. Do not act on it without advice specific to your circumstances from a qualified professional.</p>
      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>We try to keep this site accurate and current but make no warranty that it is. Accounting standards, tax rules and filing requirements change, and older articles may not reflect current requirements.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>All content on this site is owned by Accbase Advisory unless stated otherwise. You may read, share and quote it with attribution. You may not republish it wholesale.</p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>We link to third-party sites for convenience. We are not responsible for their content.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:info@accbaseadvisory.com">info@accbaseadvisory.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
